        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已讀回條是雙向的。如果你向這位好友隱藏已讀回條，你也將無法查看對方的已讀回條。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Read receipts are visible only when both people allow sharing. Group conversations never show read receipts." : {
